Description: session manager for Wayland compositors
 dewsesh is a customizable session manager, also called a logout menu, for
 Wayland compositors, focused on providing a beautiful user experience with
 sensible defaults.
 .
 It works with any compositor implementing the layer-shell protocol
 (zwlr_layer_shell_v1), including sway, river, Wayfire, Hyprland and niri.
 .
 Irreversible actions can be stopped before they run, and the whole program
 is configured from a single file, with no CSS and no configuration required
 to get started.
